  <p><strong>Bob Mills</strong> is a storyteller captivated by the places where human ambition meets the vast, indifferent beauty of space. With a background spanning software engineering, systems architecture, and a lifelong obsession with the science and logistics of space exploration, Bob writes hard-SF that balances technical rigor with the deeply human stories of those who dare to leave Earth behind.</p>

  <p>The <em>No Blue Sky</em> series grew from a single question: <em>What would it really feel like to be the first person to live, not just visit, another world?</em> Bob&rsquo;s work explores the intersection of cutting-edge aerospace engineering, international politics, human psychology, and the quiet, transformative wonder of seeing Earth from somewhere else.</p>

